 | Deferred tax liabilities | ( [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:DeferredIncomeTaxLiabilities", "scale": "6", "id": "f-591"}] 861) |  |  | ( [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-25", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:DeferredIncomeTaxLiabilities", "scale": "6", "id": "f-592"}] 764) |
 | Net deferred taxes | $ |  [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsLiabilitiesNet", "scale": "6", "id": "f-593"}] 491  |  |  | $ |  [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-25", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsLiabilitiesNet", "scale": "6", "id": "f-594"}] 569  |
Our valuation allowance is primarily attributable to non-U.S. net operating loss carry-forwards.
At year-end 2025, we had approximately $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "mar:DeferredTaxAssetsTaxCreditCarryforwardsSubjectToExpiration", "scale": "6", "id": "f-595"}] 52 million of tax credits that will expire through 2035 and $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "mar:DeferredTaxAssetsTaxCreditCarryforwardsNotSubjectToExpiration", "scale": "6", "id": "f-596"}] 12 million of tax credits that do not expire. We recorded $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-1", "decimals": "-6", "name": "mar:OperatingLossCarryforwardsTaxableIncomeReduction", "scale": "6", "id": "f-597"}] 5 million of net operating loss benefits in 2025 and $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-22", "decimals": "-6", "name": "mar:OperatingLossCarryforwardsTaxableIncomeReduction", "scale": "6", "id": "f-598"}] 22 million in 2024. At year-end 2025, we had approximately $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards", "format": "ixt:num-dot-decimal", "scale": "6", "id": "f-599"}] 4,436 million of primarily state and foreign net operating losses, of which $ [INLINE {"unitref": "usd", "contextref": "c-24", "decimals": "-6", "name": "us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsOperatingLossCarryforwardsSubjectToExpiration", "format": "ixt:num-dot-decimal", "scale": "6", "id": "f-600"}] 2,867 million will expire between 2042 and 2045.
We made no provision for U.S. income taxes or additional non-U.S. taxes on certain undistributed earnings of non-U.S. subsidiaries. These earnings could become subject to additional taxes if the non-U.S. subsidiaries dividend or loan those earnings to an affiliate or if we sell our interests in the non-U.S. subsidiaries. We cannot practically estimate the amount of additional taxes that might be payable on the undistributed earnings.
